Package: twindb-backup
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xtrabackup, xbcloud, mysql-client, gzip, bzip2
Description: TwinDB Backup - MySQL backup tool with point-in-time recovery
 TwinDB Backup is a tool for streaming MySQL backups to blob storage with
 binlog-based point-in-time recovery. Version 5.0.0 includes improved
 security, performance, and operational features.
